---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy Notice" description="How Apex Property Renovation uses information submitted through its project inquiry form.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Privacy" title="Your details, handled with purpose." description="This notice covers the Apex Property Renovation marketing website and its project inquiry form." />
  <section class="section section-stone"><div class="wrap"><div class="privacy-copy">
    <p>Last updated October 16, 2026. We use the information you choose to share to understand your property renovation inquiry and contact you about it.</p>
    <h2>What you share</h2><p>The form asks for your name, city, project type, project details, and at least one contact method. Your role, company or ownership entity, brokerage, acquisition stage, property or listing link, project goal, budget and timing are optional. Use your own contact details and share another person’s personal information only with their permission. Please do not include private access links, payment card information, identification documents, passwords, or other sensitive personal information.</p>
    <h2>How the information is used</h2><p>Inquiries are saved in a restricted website inbox for Apex to review and manage. Optional role, company, brokerage, acquisition stage, listing link and project goal information is saved with your project details to help Apex understand the property and your involvement. Listing links are retained as text; submitting the form does not cause this website to automatically retrieve the linked page.</p><p>Submitting the form permits contact about that inquiry; it is not enrollment in a general marketing list. The form does not make a payment, confirm a booking, or automatically send an estimate.</p>
    <h2>Storage and access</h2><p>Project inquiries are stored in the website’s database and require authenticated administrator access to view. Hosting services may process technical request data as part of operating and protecting the website. Automated rate limits and a hidden spam field help reduce misuse.</p><p>This preview does not use advertising pixels or third-party analytics. Website inquiry information is separate from the existing Apex client portal. The portal has its own sign-in and project access controls.</p>
    <h2>Keeping information current</h2><p>To ask about information you submitted, request a correction, or request deletion, contact Apex at <a class="text-link" href="tel:+12563931280">256-393-1280</a>. Include your inquiry reference when available. Information should be kept only as long as needed to handle the inquiry and any applicable business or legal obligations.</p>
    <h2>Images and links</h2><p>Completed-project photography is identified on the site. Other architectural images are AI-generated design concepts, not evidence of completed Apex work. External links, including the separate client portal, may have different privacy practices.</p>
  </div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
